# Windswept Heath: the life and the sacrifice are costs (CR 602.2, 118.12), paid before the ability resolves, so a library
# with no Forest or Plains card in it (only Islands and a Swamp) leaves Bot1 a life down and without the land, and
# finding nothing (CR 701.23b) puts nothing onto the battlefield. The ability is still activatable with nothing to find.

[Bot1 Deck]
Windswept Heath
Island x6
Island x5
Swamp x4

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Windswept Heath.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Windswept Heath.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Island)
Bot1.Search()
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Windswept Heath
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
